    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small meatballer shop\u2026 Just another ordinary night\u2026 Customers come in, place their orders, and you do your job as usual. But as time passes, you start to feel that something is off. Small details that seemed unimportant at first begin to feel unsettling. Is your mind playing tricks on you, or is there really something wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this tense, single-location horror experience, you must keep working while facing the strange occurrences around you. The customers may seem normal, but are they really? Or maybe the real problem isn\u2019t them\u2026 but you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503770/extras/d0afb8e42e4887455780e5316225db3b.poster.avif?t=1741143545\" width=800 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503770/extras/d0afb8e42e4887455780e5316225db3b.webm?t=1741143545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503770/extras/d0afb8e42e4887455780e5316225db3b.mp4?t=1741143545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping, single-location horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slow-building sense of unease</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings and uncover hidden details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing moments and unexpected events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You think you're just here to serve food\u2026 but is that really your only job?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503770/extras/2190d456d621f76d14bb9189aeb6f05b.poster.avif?t=1741143545\" width=694 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503770/extras/2190d456d621f76d14bb9189aeb6f05b.webm?t=1741143545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503770/extras/2190d456d621f76d14bb9189aeb6f05b.mp4?t=1741143545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you do? Will you focus on your job and keep preparing orders, or will you start investigating the strange occurrences around you? Maybe the small details you\u2019ve been ignoring are your only chance to uncover the truth\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the time this night is over, you will learn what is really happening in the shop. But maybe\u2026 you won\u2019t want to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503770/extras/5957cc7100e303c7bbc1d187731b9b6f.poster.avif?t=1741143545\" width=800 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503770/extras/5957cc7100e303c7bbc1d187731b9b6f.webm?t=1741143545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503770/extras/5957cc7100e303c7bbc1d187731b9b6f.mp4?t=1741143545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
